### 1. Register a dedicated test user (run once; re-run -> 400 "already registered", that's fine)
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "tutortest@example.com", "password": "test1234" }

### 2. Login  --- RUN THIS FIRST, before every request below ---
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "mariam.student@example.com", "password": "Password123!" }

### 3. Who am I  (expect 200; first run: isTutor=false, tutorProfile=null)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 4. Apply as tutor  (expect 201; tutorProfile.verificationStatus = "PENDING")
POST {{baseUrl}}/tutors/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "headline": "MSc CS student & React tutor",
  "bio": "I specialise in React, Node, and PostgreSQL.",
  "education": "BSc Computer Science",
  "hourlyRate": 30,
  "subjects": ["React", "TypeScript"],
  "languages": ["English", "Arabic"],
  "certificates": ["AWS Certified Developer"],
  "experience": ["2 years TA"]
}

### 5. Get my tutor profile  (expect 200; { profile: {...} })
GET {{baseUrl}}/tutors/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 6. Update my tutor profile  (expect 200; hourlyRate 35, headline changed, rest untouched)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tutors/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "hourlyRate": 35, "headline": "Senior React & TypeScript tutor" }

### 7. Validation error (expect 400; details -> field "subjects")
POST {{baseUrl}}/tutors/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "headline": "x", "bio": "y", "education": "z", "hourlyRate": 10, "subjects": [] }

### 8. Duplicate apply (expect 400 "Tutor profile already exists for this user")
POST {{baseUrl}}/tutors/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "headline": "again", "bio": "again", "education": "again", "hourlyRate": 20, "subjects": ["Java"] }

### 9. No token (expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tutors/me
